      "writtenOn": "2023-10-16T13:55:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s not, it affects the TTL of the A/AAAA records too. The use case of SRP is that an end device register a DNS-SD service to the registrar via unicast DNS update (i.e. SRP) and it requires TTL of all RRs to be the same value. See https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/draft-ietf-dnssd-srp#name-ttl-consistency for background",
